| `--db-port` / `-P` | Database server port | `51214` |
| `--shadow-db-port` | Shadow database port (for migrations) | `51215` |
| `--detach` / `-d` | Run in background | `false` |
| `--debug` | Enable debug logging | `false` |

## Examples

### Start local database

```bash
